@* The splatted attributes have to survive the ones the component writes itself, including the two it
   only writes while they carry a value. The two of those go through a dictionary rather than being
   written on the tag, since razor reads a "dir" written there as the Dir parameter of the component. *@

<BitSticky data-val-test="bit" @attributes="_splatted">I'm a sticky</BitSticky>

@code {
    private readonly Dictionary<string, object> _splatted = new()
    {
        ["aria-label"] = "splatted label",
        ["dir"] = "rtl"
    };
}
